      "writtenOn": "2026-10-12T13:57:33Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Could we select the TX mode once before the retry loop and pass it as a constant into the `always_inline` completion and doorbell helpers? This would eliminate repeated eMPW flag checks and allow both doorbell paths to share the completion flag, barriers, DB-record update, and MMIO write. Constant propagation can retain only the accounting and assertions applicable to each mode.",
      "revId": "5824118f828e40cc822ffd3e04216b42f6c521c1",
      "serverId": "6d2eb258-4fe2-443e-8a38-ca81da23d4c2"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "0ac8d74b_dd196db0",
